sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant UI as 用户界面
    participant Service as ItemService
    participant DAO as ItemDAO
    participant DB as SQLite数据库

    User->>UI: 填写物品信息并提交
    UI->>Service: publishItem(item)
    Service->>Service: 校验物品信息
    Service->>DAO: insert(item)
    DAO->>DB: INSERT INTO item
    DB-->>DAO: 返回执行结果
    DAO-->>Service: 返回保存结果

    alt 保存成功
        Service-->>UI: 发布成功
        UI-->>User: 显示发布成功信息
    else 保存失败
        Service-->>UI: 返回失败信息
        UI-->>User: 提示发布失败
    end
